{
  "_README": [
    "The ATC's A.T. Summer Bucket List as a challenge (#1780, features/CHALLENGES.md).",
    "",
    "A DRAFT, AND THE APP SAYS SO. Transcribed 2026-09-30 from the ATC's 2025 PDF",
    "(https://appalachiantrail.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/ATC_Summer-Bucket-List_2025.pdf,",
    "co-branded 'ATC x Altra'). The ATC has not confirmed the 2027 items or agreed to",
    "run its drawing through OurHike. status 'draft' publishes, labelled 'Draft - not",
    "yet confirmed by the ATC' on every surface (maintainer, poll 2026-09-30), and a",
    "draft takes no entries.",
    "",
    "TITLES ARE THE PDF'S OWN WORDS, verbatim, typos included ('Donate to the ATC help",
    "protect'). Section order and item order are the PDF's. Nothing is paraphrased,",
    "because a hiker comparing this list with the ATC's must find the same lines.",
    "",
    "THE DATES ARE PLACEHOLDERS. 2027-05-15 to 2027-09-01 come from the design handoff;",
    "the 2025 PDF gives only the close ('by September 1'). @unvalidated until the ATC",
    "publishes 2027's.",
    "",
    "WHICH LINES ARE PLACES. 14 items name a place the ATC's own layers carry, by",
    "published POI id - the anchors block repeats each name so a reviewer can read",
    "the diff without resolving ids. 3 match any waypoint of a type (a shelter, an",
    "ATC vista, an A.T. Community), 1 the elevation profile, 3 a logged workday on",
    "the A.T. The other 76 are at-home lines (self_report). Some PDF lines that",
    "sound like places are self_report on purpose: no published layer carries a",
    "fire tower, a waterfall, a hostel or Amicalola Falls (on the approach trail,",
    "not the A.T.), and inventing a point for one is what this file must not do.",
    "",
    "TOWNS ARE OFF THE TRAIL AND SAY SO, the 'any A.T. Community' item included. The Harpers Ferry community point is 236 m",
    "from the centerline and Monson's is 2,867 m (measured 2026-09-30, release",
    "2026-09-24-2), so their items carry off_trail and an 800 m radius around the",
    "town point. The 800 m is @unvalidated - a town-sized guess, not a measurement.",
    "",
    "THE THREE MYSTERY ITEMS carry no title and no date: the ATC announced 2025's",
    "only on social media. They ship sealed and the ATC reveals one by republishing.",
    "",
    "Reviewed row by row. That is why this is committed rather than generated."
  ],
